      <description>&lt;p&gt;On June 6th, 2022, I held a seminar at &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.di.unimi.it/ecm/home/aggiornamenti-e-archivi/tutte-le-notizie/content/ethereum-virtual-currency-state-machines-and-programmable-money.0000.UNIMIDIRE-98602&#34;&gt;Università degli Studi di Milano&lt;/a&gt; about &lt;strong&gt;Ethereum: virtual currency, state machines, and programmable money&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The presentation is about Ethereum from the point of view of a computer scientist. It discusses Ethereum&amp;rsquo;s global state, the consensus mechanism, smart contracts, ERC20, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M1UDURc5cw4R7FG3S0lk14v7H1fzbsP6sOO6LL98UfQ/edit#slide=id.p&#34;&gt;
&lt;img alt=&#34;First page of the presentation&#34; src=&#34;EthereumSlidesCover.png&#34; /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The slides are publicly available (&lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1M1UDURc5cw4R7FG3S0lk14v7H1fzbsP6sOO6LL98UfQ/edit?usp=sharing&#34;&gt;Google Sheets&lt;/a&gt;; &lt;a href=&#34;EthereumSlides-2022-05-26.pdf&#34;&gt;PDF&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
